{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u26a0\ufe0f REQUIRES NVIDIA GPU (RTX 2060 or newer)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911020/extras/15afcaa04634551a6dbcce2f17a03832.avif?t=1772790716\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anime Art Generator is a powerful AI Image Generator, fully offline local AI tool that turns your text prompts into stunning anime-style illustrations in seconds.\u00a0Whether you're crafting your next project, a profile picture, designing original characters, or just having fun with creativity, this tool puts the magic of AI anime art right at your fingertips.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911020/extras/7da0dcbca88278bd57d540ee053e03cf.avif?t=1772790716\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <i> </i> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Features:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f Easy Text-to-Anime Generation:</i></strong> Just type a description and watch as the app transforms it into beautiful anime art, no configuration is needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udcbb 100% Offline, No internet No problem:</i></strong> Everything runs locally on your device \u2014 no downloads, no accounts, no data sent anywhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83c\udfa8 Fast &amp; High-Quality Outputs:</i></strong> Powered by an advanced anime-focused AI Agent, capable of generating detailed, vibrant, high-resolution images. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83e\udde0 Smart Prompt Templates:</i></strong> Built-in prompt helpers and negative tag filters for optimal results with minimal effort. <br><strong>\ud83d\udcbe Safe and Private:</strong> Everything stays on your computer. No cloud processing, no hidden uploads \u2014 your creativity belongs to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f<i> Multiple resolutions:</i></strong><i>\u00a0Full HD, HD, Square, 2K, Mobile Wallpaper</i>, create your art as you imagine it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udc31 Cute, Clean U</strong></i>I: Simple, cozy interface designed with anime fans in mind. Whether you're an aspiring VTuber, a character designer, or just love generating anime girls (and boys!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911020/extras/21d59c5fa4175d10544acf3adc9cce8e.avif?t=1772790716\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>\ud83c\udf38 <strong> Anime Artworks Generated by Anime AI Art Generator real examples:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911020/extras/45b3e83a721abb65aa2f95651d3ade7b.avif?t=1772790716\" width=1024 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911020/extras/cfb00096f9c8a9886d574520ce6c47f3.avif?t=1772790716\" width=1400 height=1400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911020/extras/f5810be97dc90b726c39b316520e58dd.avif?t=1772790716\" width=1400 height=1400 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911020?t=1772790716","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911020?t=1772790716","capsule_imag